      "name": "Tallyman of Nurgle",
      "type": "once-per-turn",
      "effect": "You gain a number of **tally points** equal to the current battle round number.\nDuring the battle round, you can spend your **tally points**. For each **tally point** you spend, you can re-roll 1 hit roll, 1 wound roll, 1 save roll or 1 ward roll for a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit.\nAt the end of the battle round, any unspent **tally points** are lost.",
